WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Crouching medium punch whiffs as Ken finishes recovering from the heavy Uppercut.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.350
Crouching light kick hits Ken as he rises.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.800
Crouching jabs continue the low confirm.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.700
Regular light Flash Knuckle launches Ken.

5
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.350
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the corner juggle.
